 results, and build the store of your dreams. Rewards and discoveries await those ready to move forward with love and patience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc64 Crafted with soul by a solo developer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a personal project filled with sincere love for pets and care for every detail, so you feel part of a lively, kind world.</p>","developers":["Chewie Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932270/97628fd332442fe2f26855256a95a5f83a90ade7/header.jpg?t=1770265518","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3932270/1807649982/644740ce03a714b2a81884e7309267393a329e51/1754545656/dash_av1.mpd?t=1755142888","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3932270/1807649982/644740ce03a714b2a81884e7309267393a329e51/1754545656/dash_h264.mpd?t=1755142888","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3932270/1807649982/644740ce03a714b2a81884e7309267393a329e51/1754545656/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1755142888","id":257179565,"name":"My Pet Store - First Gameplay Presentation (Development Phase)","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257179565/68b3c80e88144faa852785000b3c4b300612f232/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1755142888"}],"name":"My Pet Store","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and o